  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A continuation of SHARP (a previous programme under the BRCiS Consortium) 

BRCiS contributes to the resilience pillar but also to the human rights, agriculture, livestock and fisheries, economic development and the Social and Human Development pillars. The Consortium commits to align to the National Development Plan&#x2019;s vision and goals and to actively coordinate with the relevant Federal Institutions when there are targeted actions that will build community capacity to achieve these goals</narrative>
